#: ../pwntools/docs/source/globals.rst:23
msgid "Super convenient wrappers around all of the common functionality for CTF challenges"
msgstr "CTF の課題で使う一般的な機能すべてを、とても便利に包んだラッパー"

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/globals.rst:24
msgid "Connect to anything, anywhere, and it works the way you want it to"
msgstr "どこにでも何にでも接続でき、思いどおりに動く"

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/globals.rst:25
msgid "Helpers for common tasks like ``recvline``, ``recvuntil``, ``clean``, etc."
msgstr "``recvline``、``recvuntil``、``clean`` など、よくある作業のための補助関数があります"

